# Mee Events

- Read `AGENTS.md` first. Architecture and product scope live in `docs/` and `docs/adr/` (ADR 0010 active).
- Scope changes tightly. No unprompted refactors or new dependencies.
- Never commit secrets; never put backend secrets in Flutter or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
- Ban for company code: FreeLLMAPI / free-tier LLM proxies / personal AI without Privacy Mode.
- Prefer specific file mentions; respect `.cursorignore`.
- If LeanCTX MCP tools exist, prefer `ctx_read`, `ctx_search`, `ctx_shell`, `ctx_tree`.
